{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "Is there a limit on how many units can be purchased in any single month (a monthly purchase budget or supplier cap), or can you buy any quantity you want each month?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding monthly purchase limits, presenting a binary choice (limit vs. no limit) that constitutes one independent query."
}

{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "Can you sell more units in a month than you have in stock at the start of that month (i.e., is there a constraint that sales in each month cannot exceed available inventory), or is there some other rule about how sales relate to stock?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy clarification regarding the relationship between sales and inventory constraints."
}

{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "When you say \"sales in each month cannot exceed the available inventory,\" does the available inventory for a month include units purchased during that same month (i.e., you can buy and sell within the same month), or is it only the stock carried over from the end of the previous month?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the definition of available inventory, specifically whether it includes same-month purchases or only previous month carryover."
}

{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "Is there a minimum inventory level that must be maintained at the end of each month (a safety stock requirement), or can inventory drop to zero at the end of any month?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the policy for minimum end-of-month inventory levels."
}

{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "At the end of December, does the remaining inventory have any value (e.g., it can be sold later or has a salvage value), or is it simply leftover with no contribution to the objective?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the valuation of remaining inventory at the end of the period."
}

{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "Is the objective to maximize total profit (total revenue from sales minus total cost of purchases), or is it to maximize total revenue from sales only (ignoring purchase costs)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice between two mutually exclusive objective functions, which constitutes one semantically independent question."
}

{
  "action": "question",
